MooseX-RequiresClass

A Moose role using MooseX::RequiresClass can require that any class consuming it
inherits from a given base class:

    package My::Role;
    use Moose::Role;
    use MooseX::RequiresClass;
    requires_class 'My::Base';

Consuming a class that does not inherit from My::Base fails at composition time.
See the module's POD for details, the opt-out flag, and CAVEATS.

INSTALLATION

    perl Makefile.PL
    make
    make test
    make install

DEPENDENCIES

    Moose (2.0000+)

